  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>(A)&nbsp; &nbsp;Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>&nbsp;The volume of the parallelepiped determined by vectors</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp; is the scalar tripple product of given three vectors is<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>=<